        {
          "title": "\u1796\u17b6\u1780\u17d2\u1799\u1782\u1793\u17d2\u179b\u17b9\u17c7 (Flip Cards)",
          "iconType": "document",
          "content": {
            "library": "H5P.Column 1.22",
            "params": {
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": {
                    "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
                    "params": {
                      "text": "<div class=\"rise-header-block\"><h2 class=\"rise-main-title\">\u1796\u17b6\u1780\u17d2\u1799\u1782\u1793\u17d2\u179b\u17b9\u17c7\u179f\u17c6\u1781\u17b6\u1793\u17cb\u17d7 (\u1785\u17bb\u1785\u178a\u17be\u1798\u17d2\u1794\u17b8\u178f\u17d2\u179a\u17a1\u1794\u17cb Flip Card)</h2><p class=\"rise-main-desc\">\u1785\u17bb\u1785\u179b\u17be\u1780\u17b6\u178f\u1793\u17b8\u1798\u17bd\u1799\u17d7\u178a\u17be\u1798\u17d2\u1794\u17b8\u178f\u17d2\u179a\u17a1\u1794\u17cb\u1798\u17be\u179b\u1793\u17b7\u1799\u1798\u1793\u17d0\u1799 \u1793\u17b7\u1784\u1796\u17d0\u178f\u17cc\u1798\u17b6\u1793\u179b\u1798\u17d2\u17a2\u17b7\u178f\u17d6</p></div>"
                    },
                    "subContentId": "07648fc782693b20"
                  },
                  "useSeparator": "disabled"
                },
                {
                  "content": {
                    "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
                    "params": {
                      "text": "<div class=\"rise-flashcard-grid\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card-inner\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card-front\"><div class=\"rise-flip-word\">JDK</div></div><div class=\"rise-flip-card-back\"><div class=\"rise-flip-definition\"><strong>JDK (Java Development Kit)</strong><br>កញ្ចប់ឧបករណ៍ពេញលេញសម្រាប់អ្នកអភិវឌ្ឍន៍សរសេរ និង compile កូដ Java (.java ទៅជា .class) រួមមាន javac, debugger និង JRE។</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rise-flip-card\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card-inner\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card-front\"><div class=\"rise-flip-word\">JRE</div></div><div class=\"rise-flip-card-back\"><div class=\"rise-flip-definition\"><strong>JRE (Java Runtime Environment)</strong><br>បរិស្ថានសម្រាប់ដំណើរការកម្មវិធី Java សម្រាប់ End-user ដែលរួមបញ្ចូល JVM និង Class Libraries ទាំងអស់។</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rise-flip-card\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card-inner\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card-front\"><div class=\"rise-flip-word\">JVM</div></div><div class=\"rise-flip-card-back\"><div class=\"rise-flip-definition\"><strong>JVM (Java Virtual Machine)</strong><br>ម៉ាស៊ីននិម្មិតដែលដំណើរការ Java Bytecode នៅលើគ្រប់ OS (Write Once, Run Anywhere)។</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rise-flip-card\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card-inner\"><div class=\"rise-flip-card-front\"><div class=\"rise-flip-word\">OOP</div></div><div class=\"rise-flip-card-back\"><div class=\"rise-flip-definition\"><strong>OOP (Object-Oriented Programming)</strong><br>វិធីសាស្ត្រនៃការសរសេរកម្មវិធីដោយផ្អែកលើ Objects និង Classes ដូចជា Encapsulation, Inheritance, Polymorphism, Abstraction។</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rise-callout rise-callout-info\"><div><strong>ចំណាំសំខាន់:</strong> អ្នកអភិវឌ្ឍន៍ (Developer) ត្រូវការ <strong>JDK</strong> ដើម្បីសរសេរ និង compile កូដ ចំណែកអ្នកប្រើប្រាស់ទូទៅ (End-user) ត្រូវការត្រឹមតែ <strong>JRE</strong> ដើម្បីដំណើរការកម្មវិធី Java ប៉ុណ្ណោះ។</div></div>"
                    },
                    "subContentId": "4cbdc07512a2c18c"
                  },
                  "useSeparator": "disabled"
                }
              ]
            },
            "subContentId": "edf0a343c4be6e77"
          },
